{"id":"n1-104","title":"Noun を機にして","romaji":"~wo ki ni shite","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"To take the opportunity to; taking the occasion to; on the occasion of.","longExplanation":"The grammar pattern 'Noun を機にして' expresses the idea of using a certain event or situation as an opportunity to do something else. It is often used when some change or new step is taken as a result of a specific event.","formation":"Noun + を機にして","examples":[{"jp":"引っ越しを機にして、家具を新しくしました。","romaji":"Hikkoshi wo ki ni shite, kagu wo atarashiku shimashita.","en":"I took the opportunity of moving to get new furniture.","words":[{"surface":"引っ越し","vocabId":"1601880","reading":"ひっこし"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"機","vocabId":"2037700","reading":"き"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"家具","vocabId":"1191870","reading":"かぐ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"新しく","vocabId":"1361490","reading":"あたらしく","baseForm":"新しい"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4,5]},{"jp":"卒業を機にして、新しい仕事を探し始めた。","romaji":"Sotsugyou wo ki ni shite, atarashii shigoto wo sagashi hajimeta.","en":"I started looking for a new job on the occasion of graduation.","words":[{"surface":"卒業","vocabId":"1405890","reading":"そつぎょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"機","vocabId":"2037700","reading":"き"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"新しい","vocabId":"1361490","reading":"あたらしい"},{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"探し始めた","vocabId":"1593670","reading":"さがしはじめた","baseForm":"探す"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4,5]},{"jp":"このプロジェクトの失敗を機にして、会社全体の仕事のやり方を見直すことにした。","romaji":"Kono purojekuto no shippai wo ki ni shite, kaisha zentai no shigoto no yarikata wo minaosu koto ni shita.","en":"We decided to review the way the entire company works, taking this project's failure as an opportunity.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"プロジェクト","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"失敗","vocabId":"1320140","reading":"しっぱい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"機","vocabId":"2037700","reading":"き"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会社","vocabId":"1198550","reading":"かいしゃ"},{"surface":"全体","vocabId":"1395660","reading":"ぜんたい"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"やり方","vocabId":"1012960","reading":"やりかた"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見直す","vocabId":"1259900","reading":"みなおす"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6,7,8]},{"jp":"結婚を機にして、私たちは新しい町へ引っ越しました。","romaji":"Kekkon wo ki ni shite, watashitachi wa atarashii machi e hikkoshimashita.","en":"We moved to a new town on the occasion of our marriage.","words":[{"surface":"結婚","vocabId":"1254790","reading":"けっこん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"機","vocabId":"2037700","reading":"き"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"私たち","vocabId":"1311300","reading":"わたしたち"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"新しい","vocabId":"1361490","reading":"あたらしい"},{"surface":"町","vocabId":"1603990","reading":"